{"headword":"חֹר³","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.8\">1 K 21:8</a></sup> <strong>noble</strong>, late, especially Neh., v. Dr<sup>Intr. 519 n.</sup> <strong>(</strong>v. Lag<sup>BN 32</sup><strong>)</strong> cf. Nö<sup>ZMG lvii (1903), 416</sup>.—only pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.8\">1 K 21:8</a> + 6 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:17\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.17\">Ec 10:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.17\">Ne 6:17</a> + 3 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹרֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.12\">Is 34:12</a>;—<em>nobles</em> in Naboth’s city <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.8\">1 K 21:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 21:11\" href=\"/I_Kings.21.11\">11</a>; nobles of Judah, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹרֵי יְהוּדָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:17\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.17\">6:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 13:17\" href=\"/I_Kings.13.17\">13:17</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 27:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.27.20\">Je 27:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 39:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.39.6\">39:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 6:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.6.17\">Ne 6:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.17\">13:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הח׳ והסגנים</span> (in Jerusalem) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 2:16\" href=\"/Nehemiah.2.16\">Ne 2:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:8\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.8\">4:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 4:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.4.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 5:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.5.7\">5:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.5\">7:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:17\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.17\">Ec 10:17</a>, of Edom <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.12\">Is 34:12</a>.—i. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹר</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חוּר²\" href=\"/BDB,_חוּר²\", dir=\"rtl\">ii. חור